## 6. Conclusion

Global Ventures Inc. is well-positioned for continued growth through strategic acquisitions and robust portfolio management. With a diversified portfolio and a clear exit strategy, we are confident in our ability to maximize returns for our stakeholders.

The Corporate Development Division will continue to monitor market trends and assess new acquisition opportunities while preparing for potential exits in the near future. We recommend regular updates to the Executive Leadership Team to ensure alignment with our strategic goals.

